			<TITLE>a glowing cavern</TITLE>
			<DESCRIPTION select="all">
				<DESCRIPTION select="any-1">
					<DESCRIPTION>Pools of molten rock light this huge cavern from below. </DESCRIPTION>
					<DESCRIPTION>Anvils and bellows stand around a forge fed by lava. </DESCRIPTION>
					<DESCRIPTION>Black glass covers every surface of this hall. </DESCRIPTION>
				</DESCRIPTION>
				<DESCRIPTION select="any-1">
					<DESCRIPTION>The heat is almost too much to bear. </DESCRIPTION>
					<DESCRIPTION>Smoke curls up through cracks in the ceiling. </DESCRIPTION>
					<DESCRIPTION>Strange runes are cut into the floor. </DESCRIPTION>
				</DESCRIPTION>
